    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/bcf2aa41390a91e5e14818b05a88c8c4.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Freshly graduated, you and your team of mechanics must work together to repair as many cars as possible before your shift ends. Take part in an intense adventure, recruit the best mechanics and become true mechanic heroes together!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/989326d09282f0b7b6eaafc648579637.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Playable with up to 4 players. In local and/or online multiplayer, work together to get the highest score and unlock new levels and characters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d123aca710c0cd7aa0f7b5f79d852f58.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d123aca710c0cd7aa0f7b5f79d852f58.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/496e51f4b5e669296c8ffd101745a0f1.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Get ready to become an elite mechanic! Change the wheels, repair the body of the car or recharge the battery, car maintenance will no longer have any secrets for you!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/41ca6c49bc2f4f4b638a728e230150ba.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/41ca6c49bc2f4f4b638a728e230150ba.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>PHYSICS!</strong><br><br>Forget the safety rules and save time with hero physics. Throw tools, wheels or lightbulbs, it's much more convenient!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/06b8b4dc2c454ea5af62064e8f96d004.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/06b8b4dc2c454ea5af62064e8f96d004.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/e0aa0113a13808fb70a01d0963999d19.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Travel the world, discover unique environments and complete complex tasks that will push your coordination skills to the limit. <br><br>Over 25 levels for you and your team to discover and master!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/35c68f07d75cfe6a94006764a5fec0d5.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/35c68f07d75cfe6a94006764a5fec0d5.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>COMPETITIVES RACES!</strong><br><br>Play against your friends in a competitive racing mode, because a team of mechanics always needs a driving champion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d38ca33c5a530c142df8c0e39bccc2da.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d38ca33c5a530c142df8c0e39bccc2da.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/bcf2aa41390a91e5e14818b05a88c8c4.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Freshly graduated, you and your team of mechanics must work together to repair as many cars as possible before your shift ends. Take part in an intense adventure, recruit the best mechanics and become true mechanic heroes together!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/989326d09282f0b7b6eaafc648579637.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Playable with up to 4 players. In local and/or online multiplayer, work together to get the highest score and unlock new levels and characters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d123aca710c0cd7aa0f7b5f79d852f58.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d123aca710c0cd7aa0f7b5f79d852f58.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/496e51f4b5e669296c8ffd101745a0f1.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Get ready to become an elite mechanic! Change the wheels, repair the body of the car or recharge the battery, car maintenance will no longer have any secrets for you!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/41ca6c49bc2f4f4b638a728e230150ba.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/41ca6c49bc2f4f4b638a728e230150ba.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>PHYSICS!</strong><br><br>Forget the safety rules and save time with hero physics. Throw tools, wheels or lightbulbs, it's much more convenient!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/06b8b4dc2c454ea5af62064e8f96d004.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/06b8b4dc2c454ea5af62064e8f96d004.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/e0aa0113a13808fb70a01d0963999d19.avif?t=1705160172\" /></div><br><br><br>Travel the world, discover unique environments and complete complex tasks that will push your coordination skills to the limit. <br><br>Over 25 levels for you and your team to discover and master!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/35c68f07d75cfe6a94006764a5fec0d5.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/35c68f07d75cfe6a94006764a5fec0d5.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><br><strong>COMPETITIVES RACES!</strong><br><br>Play against your friends in a competitive racing mode, because a team of mechanics always needs a driving champion!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d38ca33c5a530c142df8c0e39bccc2da.poster.avif?t=1705160172\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2061620/extras/d38ca33c5a530c142df8c0e39bccc2da.webm?t=1705160172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
